	(text "4 x SN74AXC8T245PWR (LCSC C882718). DIR1 = H, DIR2 = L: all 8 bits A (1V8, FPGA) -> B (3V3).\n~OE: from the FPGA (j3_oe_n) with R1201 10 k to 1V8, outputs Hi-Z until user logic drives it low.\nChannel order is free (all outputs): reorder for layout and re-run tools/sheets/12_level_shift.py."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
